// REQUIRES: long
// P03.26 (M9, R3): many local types in one function cost near-linear time.
// noteImplicitTParams looked at every object of the function scope for each
// local type (30000 types: 2.1 s, 100000 types: 25 s); the type parameters of
// a scope are now collected once (Inputs/check-linear.py: 6250 and 100000
// types, at most 48 times the CPU time). A plain and a generic function (the
// local
// types still depend on T: see instantiation-cycle-local.test).
// RUN: %python %S/Inputs/check-linear.py --label local-types-many --out %t.p.lin1 --n 100000 --gen "%S/Inputs/gen-local-types.py {n}" -- %gopp check {file}
// RUN: %python %S/Inputs/check-linear.py --label local-types-many-2 --out %t.g.lin2 --n 100000 --gen "%S/Inputs/gen-local-types.py {n} generic" -- %gopp check {file}
